  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Samples of two radioactive nuclides X and Y are held in a container. The number of particles of X is half the number of particles of Y. The half-life of X is twice the half-life of Y.</p>\n<p>What is the initial value of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{activity of radioisotope X}}{\\textit{activity of radioisotope Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
